.TH EUCLID-CLI-EAP-LIST-PLATFORMS 1 "October 2026" "euclid-cli 1.0.53" "Euclid CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
euclid-cli-eap-list-platforms \- list the platform declarations of a namespace
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B euclid-cli eap list-platforms
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists the platform declarations of the current namespace, each with the
objects it owns and the declaration last applied.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR euclid-cli-eap-apply (1),
.BR euclid-cli-eap-get-platform (1)
